Z||000002||JSocha||08-10-2001||03:28 PM||||Ed, you are now out there, only reaching in desperation to grab a hold of any straw in which you can, to replenish your now diminished ego to which I successfully deflated.  <P>Especially when you have to play hide and seek (in other threads) and dropping my moniker (http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum6/HTML/002887.html) as if it is a free coupon to use when ever you feel like it.<P>Now you started this thread.  Were you not just complaining about someone using your moniker?<P>You are just an immature child, who when he gets his a$$ spanked attempts to slap back in utter protest.<P>Now I am going to revert back to my <I>“informal”</I> style of improvisation as I am my own writer, to which I typically take a lax attitude to when interacting with people here on the forum and hopefully appeal to your senses of misguided logic.<P>I hope through this that you can comprehend the very simple logistics of what I have to say in the most simplistic of forms that any intelligent second grader would be more then likely to understand.<P>If someone here would have started an argument that there “glass was half full”, you would be immediately in there arguing and putting on a show that “No, the glass is in fact half empty” spouting off all kinds of supportive ideological evidence and “what-nots” to substantiate your argument.<P>And if they would have started that exact same argument, but stated that there “glass was half empty”, again you would immediately be in there arguing on the other side of the fence and putting on once again a show that “No, the glass is in fact half empty” and again spouting off all kinds of supportive ideological evidence to once again substantiate your argument on that side for what ever reason you can come up with.<P>It is a “no win” situation to which you enjoy when it comes to you, as your only clear intent is to come in here just to antagonize people in one form or another and to which others have acknowledge and noted.<P>Me?  Typically I would have just come in and said, “Hey, looks like you could use a refill”.  And leave it at that.  You on the other hand, even when the comments are in shear fun, have to elaborate your now edified lifestyle on everyone that posts.<P>Then, when you have gotten the pot so stirred up, the air in here is so full of tension, you have insulted, disagreed, attacked any individual either directly or indirectly and argued with whom ever you can get into the debate, you expect that when you suddenly decide to make a sarcastic remark or what you feel would normally be taken as a funny comment, that everyone is just supposed to either drop, lay down, roll over or bend over backwards to you and respectfully take it up the a$$?<P>What is your major malfunction Ed?<P>Lets find out now who is the bigger man of both of us around here by going back, as I do not go around proclaiming I am the “Alpha Male” like you come across in your posts.  But if I was, I would have to refer you to my recent joke about the three men comparing units, as I would be the third man, “dodging traffic” while you would be unable to even reach the rail, let alone get it past your fly.<P>Attacking a person directly is one thing, but when it comes to attacking indirectly someone’s wife, friend or whom ever he or she has a personal relationship with is absolutely the lowest thing any individual can succumb to.  Especially after what has been going on recently, no matter to whom may have had an intricate part of it.<P>For example:  [Ed, I want you to insert the most derogatory and degrading comment that you or the most disgusting individual ever could conceive and postulate about your mother here]  <P>I just had to edit mine out as it was even to low for me to go and post here and went far below my integrity as a human being which I will not allow myself to stoop to.<P>Now imagine how that comment or statement would have felt deep down inside Ed if someone else, other then you would have said it after all the aforementioned?  <P>I would be willing to bet you that it would neither have been a very well received comment by you as an individual nor a pleasant statement to any others, now would it?  That is if you take the time to momentarily put yourself in someone else’s shoes.<P>Does this somehow and effectively get the point across through your otherwise “thick head” of what others and I have been attempting to relay to you all along in one form or another?  Are you that incapable to grasp something that is in fact this simple?<P>You attack and insult anyone that you can that crosses your path and in some cases for no reason at all.  And who might I add is the one making a point to do this at all possible corners?  <B>YOU ARE ED!</B><P>If you are going to come in here and proclaim how intelligent you really are to everyone through your white wash, at least you better have the cohonas to back up your mindless tripe when challenged other then attempting in all lameness as you have been doing.<P>As far as my education that you were so concerned about earlier.  I went to the University of North Dakota from 1986 to 1990.<P>I found, much like your posts, that even the volumes of books students are required to read, they themselves meander around before finally getting to the point, if there is even one there after falling asleep.  <P>I found it so ridiculously boring when I read them, that I lost my interest and found work in the real world more challenging and rewarding.  I still read the books, went to the classes, didn’t do my home work or take the exams, so I did not come out of it with a little piece of paper saying I was superior.<P>You have only been “spoon fed” the rudimentary basics to even remotely and cognitively formulate an understanding of the real world.<P>However, there is a much bigger world to which you must realize that is awaiting you.  The ideologies you are being edified in now are only a small taste of the “shovel full” you are going to be eventually fed and able to digest from the schooling of “Hard Knocks!”<P>What does it take for a man to really change, Ed?<BR>What does it honestly take to be a better man?<P>I really wonder if you have the capacity, let alone the cognitive ability as a human being to understand any of this.  Instead, you just run around the forum screaming your injustices.<P>Now, if you will excuse me, I am leaving out of town for the weekend with my wife and will not be back until Monday morning at which time I will have the opportunity to catch up on the threads.<P>Good by Ed.<P>Respectfully signed electronically,<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
